Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e645ade0-a0ac-3f85-80bc-d9885919dde5.xml</text>
